<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St Jude cut by Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St Jude cut by Morgan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut its rating of St. Jude Medical Inc on Wednesday to an outperform rating from its prior rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares of St Jude closed at 42-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
